sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant Button as 关闭按钮
    participant Window as MainWindow
    participant GUI as GUI主线程/事件循环
    participant Thread as 数据库QThread
    participant Worker as DatabaseWorker
    participant DB as SQLite连接
    participant App as QApplication

    alt 点击界面“关闭”按钮
        User->>Button: 点击
        Button->>Window: clicked → close()
    else 点击窗口标题栏关闭
        User->>Window: 窗口关闭请求
    end

    Window->>Window: closeEvent(event)
    Window->>Worker: request_close_database.emit()
    Note over Window,Worker: Worker 已 moveToThread；请求排队到数据库线程执行
    par GUI主线程等待
        Window->>Thread: wait(3000)
        Note over Window,GUI: wait 在 GUI 主线程同步等待，期间 GUI 事件循环被阻塞
    and 数据库线程处理关闭请求
        Worker->>Worker: close_database()
        Worker->>DB: 关闭连接并置为 None
        Worker-->>Thread: database_closed.emit()
        Note over Thread,GUI: QThread 对象属于 GUI 线程；跨线程 AutoConnection 将 quit() 排入 GUI 事件队列
    end

    Thread-->>Window: wait() 3 秒后返回 False
    Window->>Window: 提示“数据库线程未能在3秒内正常退出”
    Note over Window,GUI: QMessageBox.information 是模态调用，会运行嵌套事件循环
    GUI->>Thread: 模态提示框期间处理已排队的 quit()
    Thread->>Thread: 数据库线程事件循环退出
    Thread-->>Worker: finished → deleteLater()
    User->>Window: 点击提示框“确定”
    Window->>Window: event.ignore()
    Window-->>User: 本次关闭被取消，窗口仍打开

    User->>Window: 再次触发关闭
    Window->>Window: closeEvent(event)
    Window->>Window: request_close_database.emit()（Worker 已销毁，连接已断开）
    Window->>Thread: wait(3000)，线程已结束，立即返回 True
    Window->>Window: event.accept()
    Window-->>User: 窗口关闭
    Window->>App: 最后一个窗口关闭
    App-->>GUI: app.exec() 返回
    GUI->>GUI: sys.exit(app.exec()) 退出进程
